    {
      "id": "text-error-boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2280,
      "y": 310,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 365,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 164,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1064,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785124800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Fail-fast / 降级边界\n\n• 无 robot、无 RGB sensor、无 RGB\n  → observation adapter RuntimeError\n\n• 缺模型 / 依赖\n  → _run_perception 包装为 backend not ready\n\n• 其余 detect / mapping 异常\n  → 记录 perception_errors 后抛出\n\n• update_memory 未先 detect\n  → RuntimeError\n\n注意：质量筛选的 reject 不是运行失败；\n它只不进入 UniGoal persistent map，\n同时保留 filter/debug 证据。",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Fail-fast / 降级边界\n\n• 无 robot、无 RGB sensor、无 RGB\n  → observation adapter RuntimeError\n\n• 缺模型 / 依赖\n  → _run_perception 包装为 backend not ready\n\n• 其余 detect / mapping 异常\n  → 记录 perception_errors 后抛出\n\n• update_memory 未先 detect\n  → RuntimeError\n\n注意：质量筛选的 reject 不是运行失败；\n它只不进入 UniGoal persistent map，\n同时保留 filter/debug 证据。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 16
    },
